<h1>Admin · Order <%= @order.number %></h1>

<p>State: <code><%= @order[:state] %></code> · <%= link_to "back to the card", order_path(@order) %></p>

<div class="available-panel">
  Bypass writes event: nil to the log — the history will show the muted
  "direct (bypassed events)". The privileged event next to it is a different
  thing: a named event without a guard, and the log says so.
</div>

<div class="transition-buttons">
  <%= button_to "admin_override", admin_override_admin_order_path(@order),
                method: :post, class: "transition-button" %>
  <%= button_to "bypass cancel", bypass_cancel_admin_order_path(@order),
                method: :post, class: "transition-button" %>
</div>

<%= render "shared/history", record: @order %>
